        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>The Izari have just invaded your hometown, and they don't plan on stopping.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your martial arts move you learned as a fire master to destroy your enemies in brutal fashion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3878960/extras/c52a0311277a2e7771d6b5d3b9b08b45.avif?t=1770568111\" width=831 height=479 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick up enemy clubs, knives, guns and even limbs to deal massive damage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3878960/extras/8fc19604567ddedd9008de7652165a6b.avif?t=1770568111\" width=782 height=466 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unleash brutal moves like jump kicks, spinning uppercuts and bicycle kicks to turn foes into mince meat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3878960/extras/159d14026f660084190685dc1f5993eb.avif?t=1770568111\" width=931 height=465 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Save villagers in hard to reach spots to regain health and bring balance back to Kagetsu.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3878960/extras/bdd55b5fdf0e90238a79341829da72cd.avif?t=1770568111\" width=1031 height=684 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Steal enemy disguises and interrogate lone enemies to uncover the schemes unfolding.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3878960/extras/f8cd0056b7bd22fa32dc318c15f4f336.avif?t=1770568111\" width=744 height=468 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build up enough rage to unleash a devastating fireball attack that literally incinerates your enemies, or rip out their spine, arm, or leg and use it as a weapon. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3878960/extras/f518a988519eedaed8876f3403e569e4.avif?t=1770568111\" width=1090 height=674 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play with a second player in split screen for two times the fun!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3878960/extras/9993be62a2419fc55b85742a8be3bc8d.avif?t=1770568111\" width=1102 height=672 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thanks to the wonderful work of Scott Pikulski for letting me use his artwork as a basis for the game. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>The Izari have just invaded your hometown, and they don't plan on stopping.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your martial arts move you learned as a fire master to destroy your enemies in brutal fashion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3878960/extras/c52a0311277a2e7771d6b5d3b9b08b45.avif?t=1770568111\" width=831 height=479 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick up enemy clubs, knives, guns and even limbs to deal massive damage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3878960/extras/8fc19604567ddedd9008de7652165a6b.avif?t=1770568111\" width=782 height=466 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unleash brutal moves like jump kicks, spinning uppercuts and bicycle kicks to turn foes into mince meat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3878960/extras/159d14026f660084190685dc1f5993eb.avif?t=1770568111\" width=931 height=465 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Save villagers in hard to reach spots to regain health and bring balance back to Kagetsu.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3878960/extras/bdd55b5fdf0e90238a79341829da72cd.avif?t=1770568111\" width=1031 height=684 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Steal enemy disguises and interrogate lone enemies to uncover the schemes unfolding.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3878960/extras/f8cd0056b7bd22fa32dc318c15f4f336.avif?t=1770568111\" width=744 height=468 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build up enough rage to unleash a devastating fireball attack that literally incinerates your enemies, or rip out their spine, arm, or leg and use it as a weapon. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3878960/extras/f518a988519eedaed8876f3403e569e4.avif?t=1770568111\" width=1090 height=674 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play with a second player in split screen for two times the fun!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3878960/extras/9993be62a2419fc55b85742a8be3bc8d.avif?t=1770568111\" width=1102 height=672 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thanks to the wonderful work of Scott Pikulski for letting me use his artwork as a basis for the game. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "short_description": "You’re the last fire master, fighting an evil army who threaten to bring back an ancient being from hell. Punch, kick, uppercut and flame your way through legions of soldiers while exploring an open world filled with secrets and hidden codes to unlock, or with a buddy in splitscreen.",
